Ethereum also now has Layer 2s,

17
00:00:57,399 --> 00:01:01,640
whereas back then

18
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:03,760
this talk did not mention Layer 2s at all,

19
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,720
