00:07:03,639 --> 00:07:07,080
I'm being generous to Bitcoin here,

145
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:09,919
because putting Bitcoin

146
00:07:09,919 --> 00:07:11,479
PoW mining pools next to Ethereum

